OOPS Easy: Smart City Traffic Control System
Problem Statement
The Smart City Traffic Control System monitors and manages traffic flow at multiple intersections. Each intersection has:
Key → Intersection Name
Value → Vehicle Count
The system supports:
Adding intersections
Updating vehicle counts
Identifying congested areas
Dynamically adjusting traffic signals
